            <div id="comment-39" class="comment">
                <p><strong>Madeline Ferris, <a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/a_view_like_no_other#comment-39" title="Comment permalink">Jun 18, 2009</a></strong></p>
                <p>Steve...I taught with your dad at Newtown, and I know about his love for baseball. I'm sure his love for you motivated him to share with you memories of "America's Passtime". I too was an "old" Bums fan, and for many of us, lights were always dimmer after their move out of Brooklyn. I'm so happy for you that you have such outstanding and warm memories of this visit to Shea,  and of how much your dad cared to make all the arrangements to give this 10 year old kid a "once in a life time" experience  ....Madeline</p>

